{"id":"c9cb3cc51e30a056","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dependent-term.md","title":"Section of a dependent type","display":"df-dependent-term — Section of a dependent type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dependent-term","aliases":["16-df-dependent-term","Dependent term"],"display":"df-dependent-term — Section of a dependent type","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-type]]"],"source":"§10.4 p.615 (PDF635), terms as sections; §10.1 p.584 (PDF604)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dependent-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dependent-term</span><span>Dependent term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-term — Section of a dependent type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.4 p.615 (PDF635), terms as sections; §10.1 p.584 (PDF604)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a>。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(\\gamma)\">\\(\\sigma(\\gamma)\\)</span> 直接作为集合读取；本页不假设任意码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对类型构造封闭。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_\\sigma\">\\(\\pi_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\)</span> 由下文定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_2\\)</span> 是有序对的第二分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 在第二式遍历函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\qquad\n\\pi_\\sigma\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\qquad\n\\pi_\\sigma\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_2\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ t,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in(\\Gamma.\\sigma)^\\Gamma\\mid\\pi_\\sigma\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_2\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ t,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in(\\Gamma.\\sigma)^\\Gamma\\mid\\pi_\\sigma\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma)\\bigl(t(\\gamma)=(\\gamma,t_2(\\gamma))\\land t_2(\\gamma)\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma)\\bigl(t(\\gamma)=(\\gamma,t_2(\\gamma))\\land t_2(\\gamma)\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依赖项取显示投影的截面；第二分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_2\">\\(t_2\\)</span> 给出逐点值。截面携带语境坐标，不能把它直接等同于逐点值函数。来源：§10.4 p.615（PDF635），以及 §10.1 p.584（PDF604）的集合族展示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U$、$U\\in\\mathcal U$、$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma$，采用 [[16-df-dependent-type]]。各 $\\sigma(\\gamma)$ 直接作为集合读取；本页不假设任意码集 $U$ 对类型构造封闭。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_2","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\qquad\n\\pi_\\sigma\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma.","display":true},{"tex":"t_2\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ t,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in(\\Gamma.\\sigma)^\\Gamma\\mid\\pi_\\sigma\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma)\\bigl(t(\\gamma)=(\\gamma,t_2(\\gamma))\\land t_2(\\gamma)\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"t_2","display":false}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"4967c7da565ea201","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U$、$U\\in\\mathcal U$、$A:\\Gamma\\to U$ 为集合族，使用 [[16-df-dependent-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma$。$\\mathsf{Tm}$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面约定。"},{"id":"ca928a31eb017424","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本页为集合模型；$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为集合，$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族。$\\Gamma.A$、$\\pi_A$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-type-total-space]]，$\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-term|df-dependent-term — Section of a dependent type]]"}],"outgoing":["093bd17785f1dbfc"]}